er's fixation with Bravo rubs his Delta teammates the wrong way. A resource drop offers multiple advantages, but reaching it won't be easy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jRGdgtXrVornAZM4yY0ypEYc1PW.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-04\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Meeting the Enemy\",\"overview\":\"Sick teammates pose risks to both camps. Drew and Drake cross the river to intimidate their competition, but things don't go as planned.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rco8paUQtzbnDYD9RN2pOSLfGaT.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Winners Are Made\",\"overview\":\"As the competition winds down, the exhausted survivalists face betrayal and a final challenge that tests their endurance and navigation skills.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k9zvMpY4LhbWkOmbeOHhbFbOTZ1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-09-11\",\"runtime\":62}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-03-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}